// Step 2: the melody in D (voice 1, as in amazing-grace-melody-d) over the bass of the solo
// arrangement without its fills (voice 2): the chord's root on beat 1, ringing for the whole bar.
// Chords: D D G D | D D A A. Roots: open D, G on string 6 fret 3, open A.
\title "Amazing Grace: melody and bass, in D"
